  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bMarketError\00\00\00\00$\00\00\00G`upgrade` was called with an `operator` that is not the contract owner.\00\00\00\00\0fUpgradeNotOwner\00\00\00\02X\00\00\00qA config value is out of bounds, a range or ordering invariant is\0aviolated, or the feed id is not a V3 stream id.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dInvalidConfig\00\00\00\00\00\02\bc\00\00\003The flat settlement price is not strictly positive.\00\00\00\00\0cInvalidPrice\00\00\02\bd\00\00\00xAn illegal status transition, an unknown status discriminant, or an\0aaction that requires a different operational status.\00\00\00\0dInvalidStatus\00\00\00\00\00\02\be\00\00\00XAn accrual-rate parameter, borrowing or funding, changed without a\0asame-ledger `accrue`.\00\00\00\10MarketNotAccrued\00\00\02\bf\00\00\00UThe operational status halted the action: `Frozen`, or `Retired` on\0athe market paths.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cMarketFrozen\00\00\02\c0\00\00\00gA size-growing increase ran while the market does not accept opens,\0aor the target side has ADL enabled.\00\00\00\00\0eIncreaseHalted\00\00\00\00\02\c1\00\00\005Retirement was attempted while positions remain open.\00\00\00\00\00\00\10MarketNotCleared\00\00\02\c2\00\00\00/A number that must be non-negative is negative.\00\00\00\00\17NegativeValueNotAllowed\00\00\00\02\c6\00\00\00AThe resulting position notional is below `min_position_notional`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\14NotionalBelowMinimum\00\00\02\c7\00\00\00MThe position notional, or an increase delta, exceeds\0a`max_position_notional`.\00\00\00\00\00\00\14NotionalAboveMaximum\00\00\02\c8\00\00\00NMargin is below the initial-margin floor after an open, increase, or\0awithdraw.\00\00\00\00\00\12InsufficientMargin\00\00\00\00\02\c9\00\00\00iA side's reserved value exceeds the utilization cap of half the vault\0abalance, after an open or a redeem.\00\00\00\00\00\00\13UtilizationExceeded\00\00\00\02\ca\00\00\00DA side's open interest would exceed the `m